    {
      "body": "@DarkSharpness @HydraQYH rebased onto current main (head 3aeabba), run-ci is already on so CI should pick it up. Its a small change in the DSA tilelang bf16 decode kernel: on gfx942 under dp-attention each rank runs all 64 heads and the kernel asked for 115200 bytes of LDS (limit 65536), so decode capture crashed. Capping heads per block to 16 on gfx942 fixes it, gfx950 and CUDA keep the 64 cap they had. Could one of you do the codeowner review?\n",
      "created_at": "2026-10-02T16:14:52Z",
